{
    "chapter_num": 14,
    "verses_count": 24,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Lot’s Captivity and Rescue"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And it came to pass in the days of Amraphel king of Shinar, Arioch king of Ellasar, Chedorlaomer king of Elam, and Tidal king of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Heb. goyim"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "nations, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " they made war with Bera king of Sodom, Birsha king of Gomorrah, Shinab king of Admah, Shemeber king of Zeboiim, and the king of Bela (that is, Zoar). "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "All these joined together in the Valley of Siddim (that is, the Salt Sea). "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Twelve years they served Chedorlaomer, and in the thirteenth year they rebelled."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "In the fourteenth year Chedorlaomer and the kings that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " with him came and attacked the Rephaim in Ashteroth Karnaim, the Zuzim in Ham, the Emim in Shaveh Kiriathaim, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and the Horites in their mountain of Seir, as far as El Paran, which "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " by the wilderness. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then they turned back and came to En Mishpat (that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Kadesh), and attacked all the country of the Amalekites, and also the Amorites who dwelt in Hazezon Tamar."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the king of Sodom, the king of Gomorrah, the king of Admah, the king of Zeboiim, and the king of Bela (that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Zoar) went out and joined together in battle in the Valley of Siddim "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "against Chedorlaomer king of Elam, Tidal king of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Heb. goyim"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "nations, Amraphel king of Shinar, and Arioch king of Ellasar—four kings against five. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now the Valley of Siddim "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was full of"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " asphalt pits; and the kings of Sodom and Gomorrah fled; "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "some"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " fell there, and the remainder fled to the mountains. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then they took all the goods of Sodom and Gomorrah, and all their provisions, and went their way. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "They also took Lot, Abram’s brother’s son who dwelt in Sodom, and his goods, and departed."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then one who had escaped came and told Abram the Hebrew, for he dwelt by "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Heb. Alon Mamre"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the terebinth trees of Mamre the Amorite, brother of Eshcol and brother of Aner; and they "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " allies with Abram. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now when Abram heard that his brother was taken captive, he armed his three hundred and eighteen trained "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "servants"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " who were born in his own house, and went in pursuit as far as Dan. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He divided his forces against them by night, and he and his servants attacked them and pursued them as far as Hobah, which "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. on the left hand of"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "north of Damascus. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So he brought back all the goods, and also brought back his brother Lot and his goods, as well as the women and the people."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the king of Sodom went out to meet him at the Valley of Shaveh (that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the King’s Valley), after his return from the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. striking"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "defeat of Chedorlaomer and the kings who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " with him."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Abram and Melchizedek"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Melchizedek king of Salem brought out bread and wine; he "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the priest of God Most High. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he blessed him and said:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Blessed be Abram of God Most High,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Possessor of heaven and earth;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And blessed be God Most High,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Who has delivered your enemies into your hand.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he gave him "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "one-tenth"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "a tithe of all."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now the king of Sodom said to Abram, “Give me the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. souls"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "persons, and take the goods for yourself.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But Abram said to the king of Sodom, “I have raised my hand to the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", God Most High, the Possessor of heaven and earth, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "that I "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "will take"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " nothing, from a thread to a sandal strap, and that I will not take anything that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " yours, lest you should say, ‘I have made Abram rich’— "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "except only what the young men have eaten, and the portion of the men who went with me: Aner, Eshcol, and Mamre; let them take their portion.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}